  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MULTISECTORAL REGIONAL DEVELOPMENT PROGRAM TO ELEVATE THE QUALITY OF LIFE IN ONE OF COLOMBIA&apos;S POOREST AND MOST BIOLOGICALLY DIVERSE REGIONS. THE PROGRAM SEEKS TO PROMOTE THE DEVELOPMENT OF SUSTAINABLE SOURCES OF INCOME GENERATION AND TO CONSOLIDATE INSTITUTIONAL STRUCTURES IN ORDER TO BETTER MANAGE NATURAL RESOURCES.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
